OL,3,AAnthropic flags revenue surge to
OL,4,Ainvestors ahead of stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) giant
OL,7,FAnthropic saw its revenue surge by 45%
OL,8,Fto $16.8bn (#12.7bn) in the three
OL,9,Fmonths to the end of September, the BBC
OL,10,Funderstands.
OL,12,FThe figures were revealed by the
OL,13,FClaude-developer in a briefing for
OL,14,Fprospective investors on Wednesday as
OL,15,Fit lays the groundwork for a stock
OL,16,Fmarket listing, which is expected to
OL,17,Ftake place before the end of the year.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
